{"id": 31, "name": "Moskov", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/6/60/Hero311-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021141344", "cls": ["Marksman", ""], "specialty": ["Finisher", "Chase"], "difficulty": "50", "stats": ["20", "60", "60", "50"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", ""], "story": "A warrior of the desert that embraced the darkness to seek his revenge.", "skills": [{"name": "Spear of Quiescence", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_598dfa238e4987c45419783b299aa4fc.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Moskov's Basic Attacks can penetrate the target and deal <span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+68% Total Physical Attack)</span>-<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+110% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies behind them (scales with hero level). Each Basic Attack hit reduces the cooldowns of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyss Walker</span> by 0.8s and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Spear of Misery</span> by 0.8s."}, {"name": "Abyss Walker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ad0a57328e772be2fa70550692507a86.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Moskov teleports to the target location, increasing his Attack Speed to 1.15 times for 3s. Meanwhile, his Basic Attack deals <span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+10% Total Physical Attack)</span> more damage to enemies behind the primary target."}, {"name": "Spear of Misery", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_108c7b9f3ac11309bbcdf0bf1b185d46.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12   Mana Cost: 90", "desc": "Moskov launches a powerful strike at the target enemy hero or Creep, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+60% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>, knocking them back, and revealing their position for 2s.\n\nIf the target collides with an enemy hero when knocked back, they'll both take 200<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+30% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and be stunned for 1.2s. If the enemy is knocked into a wall, they will also be stunned for the same duration."}, {"name": "Spear of Destruction", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f51734d9a49d298d05e1dc81d8e740c2.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 82, "tagname": "Teleport", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 55   Mana Cost: 130", "desc": "After a short delay, Moskov throws the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Spear of Destruction</span> in the target direction, dealing 340<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in its path and to the first enemy hero hit. Upon hitting an enemy hero, the spear pierces them, dealing 10% extra <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies behind them. The target and enemies hit by the piercing damage will be slowed by 50% for 1s (the slow duration scales with the spear's travel time, up to 3s).\n\nWhen <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Spear of Destruction</span> hits the first enemy hero, it creates a shadow behind them and refreshes the cooldown of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyss Walker</span>.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Moskov casts <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyss Walker</span> from the shadow's location (shares the same cooldown as the skill)."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Corrosion Scythe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_486be2a8